text:
This tour is for you if you want: 
(a) an early departure with arrival at the Abbey early, before anyone else is there;
(b) an “off-the-beaten path” hike at a good pace that is not technical, but is challenging at a few places; 
(c) a small group; and 
(d) an absolute expert guide, Albert.  

We had an incredible time on this tour, led by Albert, and cannot imagine having seen Montserrat any other way.
